        {
            "title": "AI末日論者也成Anthropic IPO大贏家！Skype共同創辦人五年前押注 報酬上看數百億美元",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/71fa6aa22fb036e63c2276810320beb2dfb04f7e495375b80ef3abc846fa45a1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd4d59484fb843d974b6e63fc5389719b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/ai%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E8%AB%96%E8%80%85%E4%B9%9F%E6%88%90anthropic-ipo%E5%A4%A7%E8%B4%8F%E5%AE%B6-skype%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E5%89%B5%E8%BE%A6%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%94%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E6%8A%BC%E6%B3%A8-%E5%A0%B1%E9%85%AC%E4%B8%8A%E7%9C%8B%E6%95%B8%E7%99%BE%E5%84%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-131003990.html",
