        {
            "title": "港股｜螞蟻上季純利推算升27% 多項業務傳洽外部融資",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"港股｜螞蟻上季純利推算升27% 多項業務傳洽外部融資\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">港股｜螞蟻上季純利推算升27% 多項業務傳洽外部融資</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">阿里巴巴持有33%權益的螞蟻集團，截至6月底止季度純利推算約105億元人民幣，按年增長27%，期內為阿里貢獻34.6億元人民幣利潤，螞蟻集團不予評論。另有消息指，螞蟻旗下數據庫業務OceanBase、企業解決方案業務螞蟻數科及機械人業務上海螞蟻靈波科技，正與投資者磋商外部融資，而螞蟻國際已於7月融資12億美元。螞蟻AI健康應用「螞蟻阿福」截至9月用戶達1.5億。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1-%E8%9E%9E%E8%9F%BB%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A3%E7%B4%94%E5%88%A9%E6%8E%A8%E7%AE%97%E5%8D%8727-%E5%A4%9A%E9%A0%85%E6%A5%AD%E5%8B%99%E5%82%B3%E6%B4%BD%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E8%9E%8D%E8%B3%87-130031640.html",
